  "description": "Step-thru Desigh: The electric tricycle for adults is made from 6061 aluminum alloy, making it both light and extremely durable. Its unique step-through frame is easy to lift your leg over the etrikes. The stand to floor height is 15”, more inclusive of users, friendly for women, the elderly and people with knee problems for ride.\nPower System: The 750W motor can provide the e-tricycle with up to 25MPH speed (15MPH default) and 80N.m torque, make it go over 15° high slope, conquer most road conditions. Combined with the 48V 16Ah Samsung cells lithium battery, which provides you a maximum cruising range of 45 miles in pure electric mode and 65 miles in pedal-assisted mode.\nComfortable Riding: The tricycle is designed with the road challenges of commuting and long-distance travel in mind. Equipped with multiple shock absorbs, MOZO lockable hydraulic front fork and seatpost suspension and rear frame shock absorber allowing the rider to be fully cushioned on bumpy roads.\nSafer Riding: This electric tricycle featured 180mm front and rear brakes, plus two parking brakes for added safety. The clever rear differential provide the superior stability and confidence in the corners. Upgraded light system include front and rear lights with turn signals allow you to be seen at night. The double rim wheel with reflection strip which can produce the strong reflected light ray to perform the warning function.",
